WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:07.780
Send a maintenance request to the mall team and follow it until it is fixed.

2
00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:12.590
Something needs fixing? Maintenance is where you tell the mall team.

3
00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:17.370
Say in a few words what is wrong.

4
00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:23.460
Choose the kind of problem, so it goes straight to the right technician.

5
00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:30.320
Set how urgent it is. Emergency is for safety risks or when you cannot trade.

6
00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:34.440
Tell them where to look.

7
00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:38.630
Add any detail that helps.

8
00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:41.670
Send the request.

9
00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:50.150
Your request has a number and a status. You get an email as it is assigned, worked on and done.

10
00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:56.460
Write to the team here, and add photos below to show them the problem.
